{"id": "t156-001", "text": "Long catch up with Esme. Her mum's hip op is on Thursday at the Royal, she's staying with her for the week after. Esme's shattered already. Remind me to text her Friday to see how it went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esme", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip op", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "staying with her", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esme", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "shattered", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t156-003", "text": "Graham rang. Knee replacement finally booked for March 2027, he's been on the list nearly two years. Still walking the dog Bramble twice a day somehow. Need to pop round before then. His son Lorenzo is coming over from Milan for the op and staying a month. Graham mentioned his 75th is in January too, he wants a proper bird feeder for the garden, the squirrels wrecked the last one.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Knee replacement", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "March 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "nearly two years"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Bramble", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "twice a day"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "pop round", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "before then", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lorenzo", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming over from Milan", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "a month", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "75th", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants a proper bird feeder", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t156-005", "text": "Zainab's surgery got cancelled again, third time now. She's fed up and in a lot of pain. Her husband's taking time off work to help with the kids. I should drop some food round tomorrow.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zainab", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fed up", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in a lot of pain", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "time off work", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop some food round", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t156-014", "text": "Adriana mentioned she's had her MRI results back, nothing sinister, just a bulging disc. Physio twice a week from next Monday. She's relieved.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adriana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "MRI results", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "bulging disc", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Physio", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "twice a week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "from next Monday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "relieved", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t156-021", "text": "Graham Johnson from next door says his wife's having her bunion op on 18 November 2026. He'll need help with the bins for a couple of weeks. I said I'd do them.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham Johnson", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "next door", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bunion op", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "18 November 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a couple of weeks", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t156-024", "text": "Video call with Rin and Connor. The housewarming is off, the move fell through at the last minute. They're staying put for now. Rin's still doing night shifts. Connor seemed really flat about it, said the buyers pulled out two days before exchange. I'm meeting him for a curry on Thursday anyway. Remind me to bring the board game he lent me.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rin", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Connor", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "move fell through", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the last minute", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rin", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "night shifts", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Connor", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "flat", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "two days before exchange", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "curry", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "bring the board game he lent me", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}]}
{"id": "t156-025", "text": "Isabel's knee arthroscopy went fine on Monday. She's on crutches for two weeks and bored out of her mind. Should send her some books, she loves crime thrillers.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isabel", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "knee arthroscopy", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "on crutches", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "two weeks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "bored out of her mind", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her some books", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "crime thrillers", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t156-030", "text": "Zainab's op finally happened yesterday! Two nights in and then home. Her sister Adaeze is staying to help. Don't forget to send flowers this week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zainab", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "op", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Two nights", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adaeze", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send flowers", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "this week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t156-031", "text": "Anya's daughter is doing her Grade 5 piano exam next Saturday, she's been practising every evening and is properly nervous. Anya wants to take her for pizza afterwards. Anya herself has a mole being removed on Wednesday, minor thing, but she's been putting it off for months. Text her Wednesday night.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Grade 5 piano exam", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "every evening"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pizza", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "mole being removed", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "months"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "message", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday night", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t156-032", "text": "Long chat with Abebe on the phone. His wife had a fall at work and broke her wrist, surgery on Monday to pin it. He's taking the week off to look after the kids. Their son is struggling at uni too. Should call him again on Thursday and see how the op went. He also mentioned his 25th wedding anniversary is in March 2027, wants ideas.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abebe", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fall at work", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "broke her wrist", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surgery", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "week off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling at uni", "owner": "r3", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call him again", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "25th wedding anniversary", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March 2027", "anchor": "e4"}]}
{"id": "t156-034", "text": "Cem says his dad's out of hospital and doing rehab three times a week. Speech is coming back slowly. Cem's back in London from Sunday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Cem", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "rehab", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "three times a week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Cem", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back in London", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "from Sunday", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t156-035", "text": "Grocery run tomorrow, then gym. Book the boiler service for next week.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Grocery run", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "then", "anchor": "a2"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "gym", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Book the boiler service", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a3"}]}
{"id": "t156-039", "text": "Caught up with Jess and her partner Aiko. They've just got back from Iceland, saw the Northern Lights. Aiko's started a new job at the hospital in pharmacy. Jess is training for the Manchester half in April 2027. She's doing a 10k this Sunday as a warm up and asked if I'd come and cheer. Aiko's birthday is on 28 November 2026, she's into houseplants and anything matcha.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jess", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aiko", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back from Iceland", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aiko", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job at the hospital in pharmacy", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jess", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Manchester half", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in April 2027", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "10k", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this Sunday", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aiko", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e5", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "28 November 2026", "anchor": "e5"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "houseplants", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "matcha", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "t156-040", "text": "Divya's mum is having a hysterectomy on 2 December 2026. Divya will be up north for a week after. I'm feeding Pickle while they're away.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Divya", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hysterectomy", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "2 December 2026", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Divya", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "up north", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Pickle", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "while they're away", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t156-042", "text": "Connor's sister Fern had her baby on Sunday! A little girl called Maya, 7lb 2oz. Mum and baby doing well. Must send something this week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Connor", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fern", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "baby", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "little girl", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Maya", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "7lb 2oz", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send something", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t156-052", "text": "Lorenzo's mum Carmen is in hospital again, her diabetes is playing up. He's visiting every evening after work. He said not to worry, but I need to message him tomorrow.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lorenzo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Carmen", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "diabetes", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "every evening after work"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message him", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t156-054", "text": "Cancel the hair appointment Friday, clashes with the parents' evening.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Cancel the hair appointment", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hair appointment", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "parents' evening", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t156-055", "text": "Dmitri's knee is still swollen after the ACL repair three weeks ago. Physio says it's normal. He's frustrated he can't play football this season.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dmitri", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "swollen", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "ACL repair", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "three weeks ago", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "frustrated", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "football", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this season"}]}
{"id": "t156-057", "text": "Rang Mrs Brennan for Mum. Her husband Abebe has his pacemaker check next Tuesday, and she's been poorly with shingles. Remind me to drop round some soup on Sunday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mrs Brennan", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "Mum"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abebe", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pacemaker check", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "shingles", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop round some soup", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t156-058", "text": "Fern's having her gallbladder out in a fortnight. She's terrified of the anaesthetic, never had an op before. Her partner Jamal is taking her in. I want to send her a care package the day before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fern", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gallbladder out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "terrified", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jamal", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her a care package", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t156-060", "text": "Chat with Kemal. He's settled in Bristol, Joy's PhD starts in January 2027. Their dog Luna got neutered last week and is wearing the cone of shame. Plan a visit in the spring. Kemal's mum is coming over from Izmir for Christmas and staying till mid January, so not before then. He also said work is stressful, the new manager is a nightmare.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kemal", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "settled in Bristol", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joy", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "PhD", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Luna", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "neutered", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "last week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Plan a visit", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kemal", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming over from Izmir", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Christmas", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "till mid January", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "not before then", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "work is stressful", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "manager is a nightmare", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}]}
